# Database and migrations

## Allowed operations

- Local development may use the project’s documented migrate workflow
- Release environments use **`prisma migrate deploy`** (also via `npm start` / Railway `preDeployCommand`)
- Migration tests must exercise a clean, representative upgrade path

## Forbidden without explicit authorisation

- `prisma db push` against production or shared staging data
- `prisma migrate reset` on production or shared staging
- Destructive SQL that drops ledger, audit, or personal Game Ledger history
- Inventing schema changes during visual-only or presentation tasks

## Data preservation

- Preserve immutable ledger entries and wipe/audit trails
- Admin wipe and END & DELETE must follow product rules: hide/archive or null FKs as designed — not ad-hoc physical ledger deletion
- Prefer additive, forward-only migrations
